title: Fix the no_std build of `sp-consensus-sassafras`

doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Remove an unused `alloc::vec::Vec` import from `sp-consensus-sassafras`. The crate forbids unused imports, so the import broke every build without `std`, including the runtime build of `pallet-sassafras`. The API does not change.

crates:
- name: sp-consensus-sassafras
  bump: patch
